(s - a_1)(s - 8x) = (s - a_2)(s - 7x) \implies (a_1 + 4x - a_1)(a_1 + 4x - 8x) = (a_2 + 3.5x - a_2)(a_2 + 3.5x - 7x) \implies 4x(4x - a_1) = 3.5x(3.5x - a_2) \implies 16x^2 - 4xa_1 = 12.25x^2 - 3.5xa_2 \implies 3.75x^2 = 4xa_1 - 3.5xa_2 \implies 3.75x = 4a_1 - 3.5a_2 \implies 15x = 16a_1 - 14a_2
